		</p>
		<div class="nemex-legal-links">
			<a href="https://www.nemex.com.br/politica.html?origem=blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="nemex-legal-link">Privacidade</a>
			<a href="https://www.nemex.com.br/termos.html?origem=blog" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="nemex-legal-link">Termos</a>
			<a href="https://wa.me/5511920914201?text=Oi.%20Vim%20pelo%20Blog%20da%20Nemex." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="nemex-legal-link">Suporte</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	/* --- Banner CTA --- */
	.nemex-cta-banner {
		padding: 6rem 0;
		background-color: #09090b; /* zinc-950 */
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		overflow: hidden;
		width: 100%;
	}
	.nemex-cta-container {
		margin: 0 auto;
		max-width: 80rem; /* max-w-7xl */
		padding: 0 1rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.nemex-cta-container { padding: 0 2rem; }
	}
	.nemex-cta-flex {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 2.5rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.nemex-cta-flex {
			flex-direction: row;
			align-items: flex-end;
		}
	}
	.nemex-cta-title {
		font-size: 3rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 0.95;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.nemex-cta-title { font-size: 4.5rem; }
	}
	.nemex-cta-desc {
		color: #71717a; /* zinc-500 */
		max-width: 28rem;
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.nemex-cta-action {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		text-align: center;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.nemex-cta-action { text-align: right; }
	}
	.nemex-wa-btn {
		display: inline-flex;
		height: 3.5rem;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		padding: 0 2rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		background-color: #22c55e; /* green-500 */
		color: #ffffff;
		text-decoration: none;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.nemex-wa-btn:hover {
		background-color: #16a34a; /* green-600 */
	}
	.nemex-cta-subtext {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: #3f3f46; /* zinc-700 */
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	/* --- Info Section --- */
	.nemex-info-section {
		padding: 4rem 0;
		background-color: #050505;
		width: 100%;
	}
	.nemex-info-container {
		margin: 0 auto;
		max-width: 80rem;
		padding: 0 1rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.nemex-info-container { padding: 0 2rem; }
	}
	.nemex-info-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		gap: 3rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.nemex-info-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
		}
	}
	.nemex-brand-img {
		height: 1.75rem;
		width: auto;
		object-fit: contain;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}
	.nemex-brand-tagline {
		color: #d4d4d8; /* zinc-300 */
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		line-height: 1.625;
		max-width: 20rem;
		margin: 0;
	}
	.nemex-social {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-top: 1.25rem;
	}
	.nemex-social-icon {
		display: flex;
		height: 2.75rem;
		width: 2.75rem;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		color: #d4d4d8;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}
	.nemex-social-icon svg {
		height: 1.25rem;
		width: 1.25rem;
	}
	.nemex-social-icon:hover {
		transform: translateY(-0.125rem);
		border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);
		background-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
		color: #ef4444;
	}
	.nemex-col-title {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: #d4d4d8; /* zinc-300 */
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
	}
	.nemex-link-list {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}
	.nemex-col-link {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #d4d4d8; /* zinc-300 */
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.nemex-col-link:hover {
		color: #ffffff;
	}
	.nemex-contact-box {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.75rem;
	}
	.nemex-location {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #d4d4d8;
		margin: 0;
	}

	/* --- Bottom Copyright Footer --- */
	.nemex-bottom-footer {
		padding: 3rem 0;
		background-color: #050505;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
		width: 100%;
	}
	.nemex-bottom-container {
		margin: 0 auto;
		max-width: 80rem;
		padding: 0 1rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1.5rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.nemex-bottom-container {
			flex-direction: row;
			padding: 0 2rem;
		}
	}
	.nemex-copyright {
		color: #52525b; /* zinc-600 */
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin: 0;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}
	.nemex-legal-links {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 2rem;
	}
	.nemex-legal-link {
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		color: #52525b; /* zinc-600 */
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: color 0.2s ease;
	}
	.nemex-legal-link:hover {
		color: #ffffff;
	}
</style>
